# Solemnity: "Counters can't be put on artifacts, creatures, enchantments, or lands" (CR 122.6, 101.2). Before it arrives,
# Mazemind Tome's "{T}, Put a page counter on this artifact: Scry 1" is paid and the Tome has one page counter (the positive
# control). With Solemnity out, that cost can't be paid (CR 118.3, the ruling), so neither of the Tome's abilities is offered,
# and the counter already on it stays (the ruling). Walking Ballista cast for X = 1 enters with no counter (the ruling: counters
# as it enters) and dies as a 0/0 (CR 704.5f).

